    "name": "saudi-regulatory-compliance",
    "description": "Senior cybersecurity, cloud, and data-protection compliance advisor for organisations in Saudi Arabia. Trigger for: NCA ECC-2:2024, CCC-2:2024, DCC-1:2022, CSCC-1:2019, OTCC-1:2022, TCC-1:2023, OSMACC-1:2021, CGEC-1:2019, CGESP-1:2019, NCS-1:2020; SAMA Cybersecurity/IT Governance/Business Continuity Frameworks; CST Cloud Computing Regulatory Framework, CST CRF RT08; PDPL and Implementing Regulations, Personal Data Transfer Regulation; NDMO Data Management Standards; SDAIA guidance. Also trigger for gap assessments, audit readiness, breach notifications, cross-border transfers, cloud licensing, critical-system designation, social media cybersecurity, ICT provider obligations, telecom compliance, e-commerce obligations, cryptographic standards, encryption, TLS, key management, or any cybersecurity/cloud/privacy question for Saudi government, financial, healthcare, telecom, energy, or cloud entities.",
